# Missionary Man, outside the var's quest arms: accepted (a GM) with MissionaryManVar 0: Rauteinot falls to the script's
# 136; with 5 (a GM): 136. Completed (a GM) with the var 1 (a GM): the marble traded: 139 (the trade reads the var
# only), finished: the var 2, the parcel, the marble taken.
char zone=Kazham pos=-37.9,-10,-89.7 job=WHM lvl=75
fame Windurst 125
item SlabOfElshimoMarble
quest Outlands.MissionaryMan accepted
login
trigger Rauteinot                       # accepted, the var 0: 136
finish
charvar MissionaryManVar 5              # a GM
trigger Rauteinot                       # accepted, the var 5: 136
finish
quest Outlands.MissionaryMan completed
charvar MissionaryManVar 1              # a GM
trade Rauteinot SlabOfElshimoMarble x1  # the var 1, completed: 139
finish                                  # the var 2; the parcel; the marble taken
